#: ../../introduction/installation.rst:26 57d301a2d6a04e2e9621e4122f450392
msgid ""
"No credentials are needed for Info requests. Signed Exchange actions "
"require an Ethereum account signing key and its corresponding main "
"account or approved API-wallet relationship."
msgstr ""
"Info 请求不需要凭据。已签名的 Exchange 操作需要 Ethereum 账户签名密钥及与之对应的 main "
"account 或获批准的 API wallet 关系。"
